%h2.h4.mb-3 Laps
- if laps.any?
  %table.table.lap-table
    %thead
      %tr
        %th Lap
        %th Time
        %th Top speed
    %tbody
      - laps.each do |lap|
        %tr{ class: ("table-success" if lap.best), data: { lap_id: lap.id } }
          %td= lap.number
          %td= lap.formatted_time
          %td= lap.top_speed&.round(1)
- else
  %p.text-muted No laps yet. Set the start/finish line on the map to detect laps.
